            "detailed_description": "The world is in dire need of a hero…<br><br>Such a shame it’ll have to settle for less. <br><br>Follow Alvar, Landric, and Valerie as they <br>successfully fail their way to restoring a <br>fallen dragon to her former self in hopes <br>of stopping another dragon-god from <br>obliterating mankind.<br><br>* Read the Dev's Dragons' Twilight novel (Free at Smashwords)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> No Random Encounters<br></li><li> Dungeon Puzzles<br></li><li> 100+ Abilities to  Find and Master<br></li><li> Minimal Level Grinding Required<br></li><li> Easily Swap Ability Sets by Changing Equipment.<br></li><li> In-game Tutorial for RPG Newbies</li></ul>",
